%% request: a slack bot that answers from our docs
%% fixed from tool errors
flowchart LR
    Member([💬 Team member @mentions bot]) --> Slack{{Slack Events API}}
    Slack -->|app_mention| Handler[Bolt handler: ack in 3s, queue job]
    Handler --> Worker[Answer worker]
    Worker --> Retrieval[Hybrid retrieval + reranker]
    Retrieval --> LLM[LLM answer from sources]
    Retrieval -- no sources --> Refuse[🤷 'Not in our docs' + search link]
    LLM --> Grounded{Answer grounded?}
    Grounded -- no --> Refuse
    Grounded -- yes --> Reply[Post threaded reply with source links]
    Refuse --> Reply
    Reply --> Slack
    Reply --> Feedback{{👍 / 👎 reactions}}
    Feedback -->|down| Log[(Feedback log: weekly gap review)]
    Sync[(Nightly ingest: Confluence + Git)] --> Retrieval

    style Refuse fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#856404
    style Reply fill:#d1e7dd,stroke:#0f5132
